# Shell scripts run on Linux (the Steam Deck build's Steam-shortcut launcher,
# packaging/launch-steamdeck.sh) -- force LF regardless of a contributor's own
# git core.autocrlf setting. A CRLF shebang line ("#!/bin/sh\r") fails outright
# on Linux (the kernel looks for an interpreter literally named "/bin/sh\r"),
# so this can't be left to core.autocrlf's per-checkout, per-user default.
*.sh text eol=lf
